 ) Ezek 4:5 ; 1Chr 27:1 ׳ כְּמִס = id. 1Kgs 18:31 ; Num 15:12 (twice in verse) ( P ); so ׳ מ alone (adverb accusative) Exod 16:16 ( P ) Job 1:5 ; Jer 2:28 ; Jer 11:13 . — Num 23:10 b read סָפַר מִי , compare v a, so ᵐ5 Di So Kau. 2. recounting, relation מִסְפַּר הַחֲלוֺם Judg 7:15 the recounting of the dream .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5700')\">BDB5700</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4557')\">H4557</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5699')\">BDB5699</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5701')\">BDB5701</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>מִסְפָר</bdbheb><sub>133</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"1Chr 27:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,27,24)\">1Chr 27:24</ref></sup> <highlightword>number, tale</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 34:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,34,30)\">Gen 34:30</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>מִסְפַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 16:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,16)\">Exod 16:16</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>מִסְפַּרְכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 14:29\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(4,14,29)\">Num 14:29</ref>, <bdbheb>מִסְפָּרָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 21:23\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(7,21,23)\">Judg 21:23</ref> +; plural construct <bdbheb>מִסְפְּרֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:23\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,23)\">1Chr 12:23</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <highlight>number</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Judg 7:6\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,6)\">Judg 7:6</ref> <highlight>the number of those lapping</highlight>, <bdbheb>לַכּוֺכָבִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִס</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 147:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"147\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"147\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,147,4)\">Ps 147:4</ref>, + often (37 t. PH); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לֹא עָלָה הַמִּסְפָּר בְּמִסְפַּר דִּבְרֵי וגו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 27:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,27,24)\">1Chr 27:24</ref> (read <bdbheb>בְּסֵפֶר</bdbheb>) <highlight>the number did not come up into</highlight> (was not recorded in) <highlight>the book of the daily doings</highlight>, etc.; redundant after number, <ref ref=\"2Sam 21:20\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(10,21,20)\">2Sam 21:20</ref> <highlight>twenty-four (in) number</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֵין מ</bdbheb> <highlight>it was (they were) innumerable</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 41:49\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,49)\">Gen 41:49</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), with <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 6:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,5)\">Judg 6:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 7:12\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,12)\">Judg 7:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 22:16\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(13,22,16)\">1Chr 22:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 12:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,12,3)\">2Chr 12:3</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לִתְבוּנָתוֺ אֵין מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 147:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"147\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"147\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,147,5)\">Ps 147:5</ref> (of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>); absolute <ref ref=\"Jer 2:32\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,32)\">Jer 2:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 21:33\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(18,21,33)\">Job 21:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 6:8\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(22,6,8)\">Song 6:8</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַדאֵֿין מ</bdbheb> = <highlight>id.</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 5:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,9)\">Job 5:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 9:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,9,10)\">Job 9:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 40:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,40,13)\">Ps 40:13</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְאֵין לָהֶם מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 46:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,23)\">Jer 46:23</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְאֵין מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 22:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,22,4)\">1Chr 22:4</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְאֵין מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 104:25\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,25)\">Ps 104:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 105:34\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,34)\">Ps 105:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 1:6\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(29,1,6)\">Joel 1:6</ref> <bdbheb>לִגְדוּדָיו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֲיֵשׁ מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 25:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,25,3)\">Job 25:3</ref> <highlight>can his bands be numbered ?</highlight> without <bdbheb>אֵין</bdbheb> = <highlight>numerable</highlight>, i.e. <highlight>few</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וִיהִי מְתָיו מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 33:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,6)\">Deut 33:6</ref> but <highlight>let his men be few</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יָמִים מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 9:20\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(4,9,20)\">Num 9:20</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> alone <ref ref=\"Isa 10:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,19)\">Isa 10:19</ref>, usually in combination, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מְתֵי מ</bdbheb> = <highlight>a few men</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 34:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,34,30)\">Gen 34:30</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 4:27\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,27)\">Deut 4:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 44:28\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(24,44,28)\">Jer 44:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,19)\">1Chr 16:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 105:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,12)\">Ps 105:12</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אַנְשֵׁי מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,16)\">Ezek 12:16</ref> so <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שְׁנוֺת מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 16:22\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(18,16,22)\">Job 16:22</ref> adverb phrase <bdbheb>מִסְפַר יְמֵי חַיֵּיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:3\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,3)\">Eccl 2:3</ref> = <highlight>during all their lives</highlight>, compare <ref ref=\"Eccl 5:17\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(21,5,17)\">Eccl 5:17</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Eccl 6:18\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(21,6,18)\">Eccl 6:18</ref> = <highlight>appointed</highlight> (normal) <highlight>number</highlight>, <bdbheb>יָמֶיךָ מֲַלֵּא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref